{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>We are currently finalising our pre-production: follow us and add the game to your wishlist to stay tune with our progress and upcoming testing phases!</strong></u>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Survivor is a 2D survivor-like game where gravity influences your every move and shot.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as space smuggler Cassidy, accompanied by her co-pilot is B612, a former DJ droid. You accept any mission that pays enough to make you forget about the law. Will you continue your path on your own, or will you find a greater mission alongside the people you meet? \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master gravity and trajectories</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Orbital Survivor, every movement and every shot depends on gravity. Use it to dodge, aim and move with precision. Can you master space physics to survive the chaos? \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/b4116ceada2c95ec98630362c82fd300.poster.avif?t=1769419795\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/b4116ceada2c95ec98630362c82fd300.webm?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/b4116ceada2c95ec98630362c82fd300.mp4?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash chaos </strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow up everything in your path! Take control of a powerful arsenal, face waves of enemies and prove that you are the best pilot in the galaxy. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/5722d989458a1905cb92d6dd21091454.poster.avif?t=1769419795\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/5722d989458a1905cb92d6dd21091454.webm?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/5722d989458a1905cb92d6dd21091454.mp4?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into a retro synthwave universe </strong>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the 1980s retro vibes. Let the beat of synthwave rhythm your battles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/8eb8703f8cf04265a3fe283167df9704.poster.avif?t=1769419795\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/8eb8703f8cf04265a3fe283167df9704.webm?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/8eb8703f8cf04265a3fe283167df9704.mp4?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live the life of a space smuggler </strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cassidy, a space smuggler accompanied by her co-pilot B-612, a former DJ droid. Each mission presents you with decisions that will influence your journey: accept risky contracts to earn big money, go it alone, or team up with allies to take on greater challenges. Every choice counts and shapes your adventure in the ruthless universe of Orbital Survivor.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/e03fc700ff2b23007cdbf3bfa2959a90.poster.avif?t=1769419795\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/e03fc700ff2b23007cdbf3bfa2959a90.webm?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/extras/e03fc700ff2b23007cdbf3bfa2959a90.mp4?t=1769419795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057400?t=1769419795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057400?t=1769419795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/53e99a9042c409aa2c2b9166267b1e161559806b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769419795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057400/53e99a9042c409aa2c2b9166267b1e161559806b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769419795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>We are currently finalising our pre-production: follow us and add the game to your wishlist to stay tune with our progress and upcoming testing phases!</strong></u>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbital Survivor is a 2D survivor-like game where gravity influences your every move and shot.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_pa